{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3000_place", "source_sha256": "45a2639bee133f79fa257c83a1284145a61c3e0a2c5692309a6e2fb52ad44dc9", "ja": "レッスンスタジオ", "zh": "排练教室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3001_p", "source_sha256": "bef362af68332f6af774ded9ae9acd1646a6b5d40ea594610fa4e3499c7b49c8", "ja": "雪歩、今日も舞台の稽古、お疲れさま。\n撤収するから、荷物をまとめてくれるか？", "zh": "雪步，今天的舞台剧练习也辛苦你了。\n我们要准备离开了，你可以收拾一下行李吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5e2dd555e5ec242d6ac810dc8bd0b0067d5b6eadf9eb362d8df61472f65ffef9", "ja": "あっ、はい。わかりましたぁ。\nええと、台本、台本……。", "zh": "啊，好的，我知道了。\n呃……剧本、剧本……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3003_p", "source_sha256": "d4424d01bbc5c4a1b845e80169f2e2fa25252f8ba414196126c40530ffa1dcdc", "ja": "これじゃないか？\n……おや。裏になにか書いてあるな。これは……。", "zh": "应该是这个吧？\n……哦，背面好像写了什么，这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dc3f6ddc6f3a41248c515f563e88eae1f5b90863d1b5468f60aed2f63c65af92", "ja": "えっ。……あっ！　ひゃああっ！", "zh": "咦……啊！呀啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8e37280d2c74969d15deb387c7717ae13b88baabb491618c9b548df88c281b9f", "ja": "ダ、ダメですぅ、{$P$}！\nそれは練習中に思いついた、私の、えっと……。", "zh": "{$P$}，不、不可以看！\n那是我在练习中想到的，那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3006_p", "source_sha256": "a623c37588d99f6f391a90a49303a726cd0ab0cfce3e8c3ded6324aafec2127b", "ja": "あっ、趣味のポエムか！　ごめんごめん！", "zh": "啊，是你写的诗啊！这是你的兴趣嘛，抱歉抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b87d4ab6a23d2cc120ce67919b969e3cac95c120c75dc3d9739776fea6521265", "ja": "い、言わないでください～！\nまさか、内容まで読んでませんよね……？", "zh": "请、请你别说出来呀～！\n你该不会连内容都看见了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3008", "source_sha256": "a1dfdecce117471be1e8ec8a12048bd6bfbe6623737605fa9a0db3cd52ed6bf4", "ja": "胸にグッと来た", "zh": "触动了我的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3009", "source_sha256": "7b5912f49834f7ad9ed5ffca4d4fe855f1703de4b8be15b5465315d30e068d01", "ja": "まだ途中までしか", "zh": "只看了一半", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3100_p", "source_sha256": "a0db4397f836fcf8c62e7a0fa2fd3d4a04ea96047450b4abc685ed1531fd8f9a", "ja": "胸にグッとくる、ポエムだったな。", "zh": "这首诗真是触动人心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3101_p", "source_sha256": "f5820eed43dfd79c667376d4478e1423db0a971ce584c78c032f2d928edf2857", "ja": "すごく雪歩らしくていい詩じゃないか。\nかわいくて、優しくて……。", "zh": "是首非常有雪步风格的好诗，\n既可爱又温柔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3102_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bc4a76920cde2c840ce4fc72a495871f889883fe65a80f062c6a84d09096f178", "ja": "ううっ、ほ、ほめてくれるのはうれしいですけど……\nでもやっぱり、恥ずかしいですぅ……。", "zh": "呜呜，能、能被你这样夸奖，我是很开心……\n但还是很难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3201_p", "source_sha256": "a0db4397f836fcf8c62e7a0fa2fd3d4a04ea96047450b4abc685ed1531fd8f9a", "ja": "胸にグッとくる、ポエムだったな。", "zh": "这首诗真是触动人心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3200_004yuk", "source_sha256": "93bfe3335e69be45ef0820a540da5a92a13afbf460445a617476830065c1dc99", "ja": "ううっ、そんなあ……。私、恥ずかしくてもう、\n{$P$}の顔が見られません～！", "zh": "呜呜，别说了……我已经害羞到\n无法直视{$P$}的脸了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3300_p", "source_sha256": "bcc1471ceeb3d4b1edfc8cb55115ae15355ae0a99e2ff47a7ccc58b1eb95e224", "ja": "すまん、まだ途中までしか読めてないんだ。", "zh": "抱歉，我只看了一半。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0e382af196cb1fb6baa487684317f3349f3556e1d0e031e074c762b7a589a74c", "ja": "あ、謝らなくていいですよぉ！\nそんな続きが読みたそうな顔、しないでください～。", "zh": "你、你不需要道歉啦！\n请你也别露出一脸很想继续看下去的表情呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3302_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bb453f95495d1abbfa70f7f0d6eb59d7e98d45bf85933ec1a872a15a2cf688c3", "ja": "こ、これからは、私の台本がぽつんと置いてあっても\n読まないでくださいね……？", "zh": "以、以后就算我的剧本随意乱放，\n也请你不要看喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3401_p", "source_sha256": "bcc1471ceeb3d4b1edfc8cb55115ae15355ae0a99e2ff47a7ccc58b1eb95e224", "ja": "すまん、まだ途中までしか読めてないんだ。", "zh": "抱歉，我只看了一半。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_3400_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b32460c8b08e1efa0ffa716525687aa719ea853ee834800e887879f0570f64d4", "ja": "読んで欲しいわけじゃありません～！\nただ、お芝居の役作りにと思って……うう……。", "zh": "我并不是想写给人看的～！\n我只是帮助自己塑造剧中的角色……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
